{"id": "66387", "title": "暗夜蔷薇魅", "author": "悠然天下", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66387.htm", "intro": "她被爱人和至亲连手推入最尴尬的难堪.那个清美温柔的少年是她曾如此疼爱的弟弟，却成为她一生的梦魇，让她沦为他最卑微的宠物。\r\n \r\n而她爱人所有的柔情蜜意却是为了她最美丽的弟弟，身边的人一个个变得陌生……从未想过自己平凡人生一夜颠覆，被迫成为跨立于黑暗与光明间的国际掮客，游走在欲望与绝望之间。\r\n \r\n直到再次出现在那些恣意践踏她尊严的人对面，以平等的身份坐在牌桌上，向他们索回自己的一切。\r\n \r\n只是她蓦然回首，是否有些悲伤、残酷和温柔自己从不曾了解……\r\n \r\n \r\nPS:此文男猪没有一个正常的，混有耽美带虐，慎入。", "base": "files/article/html/66/66387", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10005411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10005413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10005414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10005415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10005418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10005421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10005422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10005423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10005424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10005429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "10005430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "10005431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "10005432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "10005438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "10142694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "10142696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "10142698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-110", "file": "10142701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-115", "file": "10142703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "116-120", "file": "10142710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-125", "file": "10142713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "126-130", "file": "10142716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "131-133", "file": "10142719.